<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure A-2. </span>Context-augmented reward instruction template.<span id="acmlabel3" class="ltx_acm_description ltx_centering ltx_nodisplay">context-augmented reward instruction</span></figcaption>
